---
source: crates/language/tests/codegen.rs
expression: artifacts().grammar.phon_source
---
Feature voice(+voice, -voice)
Symbol p [-voice]
Symbol b [+voice]
Symbol a
Class vowel {a}
Melody tone {H, L} anchor mora

r1:
    stage: stem
    [+voice]&onset => [-voice]
r2:
    insert H floating near mora / onset&[-voice] _
    dock tone&floating strategy nearest
Scan tone along mora within pword from left:
    H => L / H _
